      "text": "CellRank 使用 fate probabilities 来识别推定的谱系驱动基因，因此“lineage-correlated candidate driver genes”这一措辞与方法的输出性质相符。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "We use fate probabilities to uncover putative lineage drivers and to visualize lineage-specific gene expression trends."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该结论的证据强度仅限于相关性：CellRank 通过将 fate probabilities 与基因表达相关联来排序候选驱动基因，并不构成因果验证。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "CellRank 2 finds lineage-correlated candidate driver genes; the paper explicitly states correlation does not by itself unravel causal mechanisms."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在未进行独立干预（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，不能将“candidate driver”升级为已验证的因果驱动基因。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "Currently, we rank putative driver genes by correlating fate probabilities with gene expression. Although this approach has proven powerful, as shown in various applications, it is solely based on correlation."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞应明确保留“候选”和“相关性”限定，例如：“These genes are lineage-correlated candidate driver genes identified by CellRank; causal driver status has not been established.”",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
